"number": 5,
"area": "Unclassified",
"question": "What is the value of \\[\\begin{align*} &1+3+5+\\cdots+2017+2019 \\\\ -&2-4-6-\\cdots-2016-2018? \\end{align*}\\]",
"questionType": "text",
"choices": {
"A": "\\( -1010 \\)",
"B": "\\( -1009 \\)",
"C": "\\( 1008 \\)",
"D": "\\( 1009 \\)",
"E": "\\( 1010 \\)"
},
"choicesType": "text",
"answer": "E",
"solution": "Pair each subtracted even number with the next odd number. Each pair has difference \\(1\\), and the initial \\(1\\) is left over:\n\n\\[\n1+(3-2)+(5-4)+\\cdots+(2019-2018).\n\\]\n\nThere are \\(2018/2=1009\\) even numbers from \\(2\\) through \\(2018\\), hence \\(1009\\) such pairs. The value is\n\n\\[\n1+1009=\\boxed{1010},\n\\]\n\nchoice \\(\\boxed{\\text{E}}\\). Pairing nearby positive and negative terms reveals the repeated small difference.",
"solutionSource": "Adapted from MAA official solutions",
"solutionSourceURL": "https://drive.usercontent.google.com/uc?id=1RcfdsJkYkLvanhwRU9GWkLBt-2OlMOA0&export=download",
