"question": "For how many of the following types of quadrilaterals does there exist a point in the plane of the quadrilateral that is equidistant from all four vertices of the quadrilateral?\n\n• a square\n\n• a rectangle that is not a square\n\n• a rhombus that is not a square\n\n• a parallelogram that is not a rectangle or a rhombus\n\n• an isosceles trapezoid that is not a parallelogram",
