"url": "https://www.isinj.com/mt-amc10/2021-AMC-10A-Solutions%28fall%29.pdf",
"page": 9,
"alt": "Swept regions inside and outside a square, showing the central square of side s-4 and the exterior band of width 2.",
"license": "CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0",
"modifications": "Cropped official solution figure from Poppler page render",
"sourceURL": "https://www.isinj.com/mt-amc10/2021-AMC-10A-Solutions%28fall%29.pdf",
